<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wyle Electronics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wyle Electronics cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley analyst Shelby Fleck said she lowered her rating on Wyle Electronics to neutral from outperform following the company's merger announcement.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday Wyle agreed to be acquired by a subsidiary of the German utilities firm VEBA AG in a $810 million deal. Under the deal VEBA's Raab Karcher AG unit will pay $50 cash for each Wyle share.</p>
<p>-- Wyle was up 3/16 at 49-1/2 early Monday.</p>
</text>
